  "prefLabel": "Acp 104.02 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 104.02 Custodian of Records. The administrator shall be the custodian of the board's records and shall make available, upon request, those records which are subject to public inspection.\n\nSource. #7080, eff 8-26-99",
